  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "aiwritex-html-45a20f70feda",
  "type": "html-template",
  "original": {
    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n\n<body>\n  <section\n    style=\"max-width: 100%; color: #333; font-family: 'Noto Serif SC', serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; overflow-x: hidden; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n    <section\n      style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #D4AF37, #FFC72C); padding: 25px 20px; color: #fff; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between;\">\n      <section style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\">\n        <h1\n          style=\"font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.5px; text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n          微博 | 金价冲向1000元</h1>\n        <section style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: 300;\">是泡沫还是新纪元？</section>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <section\n      style=\"padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\n      <h2\n        style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #D4AF37; margin-bottom: 15px; display: inline-block; position: relative;\">\n        现象呈现：历史性突破正在发生\n        <span\n          style=\"display: block; width: 100%; height: 2px; background: linear-gradient(to right, #D4AF37, transparent); margin-top: 3px;\"></span>\n      </h2>\n\n      <!-- SVG 图表：移除渐变，使用单一颜色填充 -->\n      <section\n        style=\"width: 100%; height: 180px; background: #f8f8f8; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 20px; overflow: hidden;\">\n        <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 200\">\n          <!-- 使用单一颜色填充，替换 linearGradient -->\n          <path\n            d=\"M0,180 C30,170 60,150 90,160 C120,170 150,120 180,100 C210,80 240,60 270,65 C300,70 330,55 360,40 C390,25 400,20 400,20 L400,180 L0,180 Z\"\n            fill=\"#D4AF37\" fill-opacity=\"0.2\" />\n          <path\n            d=\"M0,180 C30,170 60,150 90,160 C120,170 150,120 180,100 C210,80 240,60 270,65 C300,70 330,55 360,40 C390,25 400,20 400,20\"\n            fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#D4AF37\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n          <circle cx=\"360\" cy=\"40\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#D4AF37\" />\n          <text x=\"20\" y=\"30\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"12\">国内外金价同步攀升（数据来源：上海黄金交易所/LBMA）</text>\n        </svg>\n      </section>\n\n      <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #333; text-align: justify;\">当AU9999黄金价格昨日收报<span\n          style=\"color: #D4AF37; font-weight: 600;\">998元/克</span>时，整个市场屏住了呼吸。这距离1000元心理关口仅一步之遥，较去年同期上涨<span\n          style=\"color: #D4AF37; font-weight: 600;\">27%</span>，创下自2011年以来的最大年度涨幅。北京某券商贵金属分析师王磊表示：<span\n          style=\"font-style: italic; color: #666;\">\"这个数字就像马拉松比赛的终点线，突破后将彻底改变市场预期。\"</span></p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section\n      style=\"padding: 25px 20px; margin: 20px 0; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\n      <h2 style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #D4AF37; margin-bottom: 25px; display: inline-block;\">\n        深度动因：四重引擎推动金价\n        <span\n          style=\"display: block; width: 100%; height: 2px; background: linear-gradient(to right, #D4AF37, transparent); margin-top: 3px;\"></span>\n      </h2>\n\n      <section\n        style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; margin-bottom: 30px; position: relative; padding-left: 15px;\">\n        <span\n          style=\"width: 20px; height: 20px; background: #D4AF37; color: #fff; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; margin-top: -10px; margin-left: -9px; align-self: flex-start;\">\n          1\n        </span>\n        <section style=\"border-left: 2px solid #D4AF37; padding-left: 15px;\">\n          <h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #333; margin-bottom: 12px; font-weight: 600;\">美联储政策与国内金价的\"蝴蝶效应\"</h3>\n          <section style=\"background: #f8f5f0; border-radius: 6px; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\n            <p style=\"font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 8px 0;\"><span\n                style=\"font-weight: 600;\">利率-美元-黄金三角关系</span>：美联储每加息25个基点，美元指数平均上涨0.8%（2023年彭博数据）</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 8px 0;\"><span\n                style=\"font-weight: 600;\">双轨制传导</span>：人民币贬值抵消部分国际金价跌幅，上海金交所2023年平均溢价达12美元/盎司</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 15px; margin: 0;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">时滞规律</span>：美联储政策影响通常在7-15个工作日传导至国内市场\n            </p>\n          </section>\n        </section>\n      </section>\n\n      <section\n        style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; margin-bottom: 30px; position: relative; padding-left: 15px;\">\n        <span\n          style=\"width: 20px; height: 20px; background: #996515; color: #fff; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; margin-top: -10px; margin-left: -9px; align-self: flex-start;\">\n          2\n        </span>\n        <section style=\"border-left: 2px solid #996515; padding-left: 15px;\">\n          <h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #333; margin-bottom: 12px; font-weight: 600;\">地缘政治\"黑天鹅\"频现</h3>\n          <section style=\"background: #f8f5f0; border-radius: 6px; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\n            <p style=\"font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 8px 0;\">俄乌冲突进入第三年，能源危机阴影未散</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 8px 0;\">中东局势持续紧张，红海航运成本飙升300%</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 15px; margin: 0;\">全球去美元化进程加速，多国央行增持黄金</p>\n          </section>\n        </section>\n      </section>\n\n      <section\n        style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; margin-bottom: 30px; position: relative; padding-left: 15px;\">\n        <span\n          style=\"width: 20px; height: 20px; background: #D4AF37; color: #fff; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; margin-top: -10px; margin-left: -9px; align-self: flex-start;\">\n          3\n        </span>\n        <section style=\"border-left: 2px solid #D4AF37; padding-left: 15px;\">\n          <h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #333; margin-bottom: 12px; font-weight: 600;\">黄金产业链价格传导揭秘</h3>\n          <section style=\"background: #f8f5f0; border-radius: 6px; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\n            <p style=\"font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 8px 0;\"><span\n                style=\"font-weight: 600;\">上游开采</span>：全球前5大金矿企业成本线升至1300美元/盎司（2023年报）</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 8px 0;\"><span\n                style=\"font-weight: 600;\">中游加工</span>：首饰加工费占终端价8-15%，调整滞后金价变动2-3周</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 15px; margin: 0;\"><span\n                style=\"font-weight: 600;\">终端零售</span>：知名品牌溢价可达原料价的200%（老凤祥2023年财报）</p>\n          </section>\n        </section>\n      </section>\n\n      <section\n        style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; margin-bottom: 10px; position: relative; padding-left: 15px;\">\n        <span\n          style=\"width: 20px; height: 20px; background: #996515; color: #fff; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; margin-top: -10px; margin-left: -9px; align-self: flex-start;\">\n          4\n        </span>\n        <section style=\"border-left: 2px solid #996515; padding-left: 15px;\">\n          <h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #333; margin-bottom: 12px; font-weight: 600;\">Z世代投资新趋势</h3>\n          <section style=\"background: #f8f5f0; border-radius: 6px; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\n            <p style=\"font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 8px 0;\">小红书黄金相关笔记半年增长<span\n                style=\"color: #D4AF37; font-weight: 600;\">380%</span>（2023年平台数据）</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 8px 0;\">1克金豆购买者中90后占比达<span\n                style=\"color: #D4AF37; font-weight: 600;\">62%</span>（银行贵金属部数据）</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 15px; margin: 0;\">平均持有周期仅<span\n                style=\"color: #D4AF37; font-weight: 600;\">11个月</span>（传统投资者为3.5年）</p>\n          </section>\n        </section>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <section\n      style=\"padding: 25px 20px; margin: 20px 0; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\n      <h2 style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #D4AF37; margin-bottom: 20px; display: inline-block;\">\n        市场影响：冰与火之歌\n        <span\n          style=\"display: block; width: 100%; height: 2px; background: linear-gradient(to right, #D4AF37, transparent); margin-top: 3px;\"></span>\n      </h2>\n\n      <section style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px;\">\n        <section style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 150px;\">\n          <section\n            style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #eee; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); position: relative;\">\n            <section style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; margin-top: -15px;\">\n              <section\n                style=\"background: #D4AF37; color: #fff; padding: 4px 15px; border-radius: 15px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\">\n                消费端\n              </section>\n            </section>\n            <section style=\"padding: 25px 15px 15px 15px;\">\n              <p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 8px 0; padding-left: 15px;\">\n                <span\n                  style=\"display: inline-block; width: 6px; height: 6px; background: #D4AF37; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 9px; vertical-align: middle;\"></span>\n                周大福等品牌金饰标价突破650元/克\n              </p>\n              <p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 8px 0; padding-left: 15px;\">\n                <span\n                  style=\"display: inline-block; width: 6px; height: 6px; background: #D4AF37; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 9px; vertical-align: middle;\"></span>\n                婚庆刚需客户占比提升至78%\n              </p>\n              <p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; padding-left: 15px;\">\n                <span\n                  style=\"display: inline-block; width: 6px; height: 6px; background: #D4AF37; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 9px; vertical-align: middle;\"></span>\n                银行金条销售需预约排队\n              </p>\n            </section>\n          </section>\n        </section>\n\n        <section style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 150px;\">\n          <section\n            style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #eee; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); position: relative;\">\n            <section style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; margin-top: -15px;\">\n              <section\n                style=\"background: #996515; color: #fff; padding: 4px 15px; border-radius: 15px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\">\n                产业端\n              </section>\n            </section>\n            <section style=\"padding: 25px 15px 15px 15px;\">\n              <p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 8px 0; padding-left: 15px;\">\n                <span\n                  style=\"display: inline-block; width: 6px; height: 6px; background: #996515; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 9px; vertical-align: middle;\"></span>\n                山东黄金等矿企净利润预增40-60%\n              </p>\n              <p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 8px 0; padding-left: 15px;\">\n                <span\n                  style=\"display: inline-block; width: 6px; height: 6px; background: #996515; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 9px; vertical-align: middle;\"></span>\n                加工企业面临\"原料焦虑\"\n              </p>\n              <p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; padding-left: 15px;\">\n                <span\n                  style=\"display: inline-block; width: 6px; height: 6px; background: #996515; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 9px; vertical-align: middle;\"></span>\n                回收市场活跃度创新高\n              </p>\n            </section>\n          </section>\n        </section>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <section\n      style=\"padding: 25px 20px; margin: 20px 0; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\n      <h2 style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #D4AF37; margin-bottom: 25px; display: inline-block;\">\n        未来展望：千元时代能否持续？\n        <span\n          style=\"display: block; width: 100%; height: 2px; background: linear-gradient(to right, #D4AF37, transparent); margin-top: 3px;\"></span>\n      </h2>\n\n      <section style=\"display: flex; align-items: stretch; margin-bottom: 25px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n        <section\n          style=\"width: 4px; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #D4AF37, #996515); margin-right: 20px; border-radius: 2px; flex-shrink: 0;\">\n        </section>\n        <section style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\">\n          <section\n            style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #eee; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); position: relative;\">\n            <section style=\"display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: -15px; margin-left: 20px;\">\n              <section\n                style=\"background: #D4AF37; color: #fff; padding: 4px 15px; border-radius: 15px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\">\n                看多派观点\n              </section>\n            </section>\n            <section style=\"padding: 25px 15px 15px 15px;\">\n              <section>\n                <p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 10px 0; padding-left: 20px;\">\n                  <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n                    style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;\">\n                    <path d=\"M12,2 L15,8 L22,9 L17,14 L18,21 L12,17.5 L6,21 L7,14 L2,9 L9,8 Z\" fill=\"#D4AF37\" />\n                  </svg>\n                  CME利率期货显示2024年6月降息概率<span style=\"color: #D4AF37; font-weight: 600;\">78%</span>\n                </p>\n                <p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 10px 0; padding-left: 20px;\">\n                  <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n                    style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;\">\n                    <path d=\"M12,2 L15,8 L22,9 L17,14 L18,21 L12,17.5 L6,21 L7,14 L2,9 L9,8 Z\" fill=\"#D4AF37\" />\n                  </svg>\n                  历史规律：美联储暂停加息后6个月金价平均上涨<span style=\"color: #D4AF37; font-weight: 600;\">14%</span>\n                </p>\n                <p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;\">\n                  <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n                    style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;\">\n                    <path d=\"M12,2 L15,8 L22,9 L17,14 L18,21 L12,17.5 L6,21 L7,14 L2,9 L9,8 Z\" fill=\"#D4AF37\" />\n                  </svg>\n                  全球债务规模突破<span style=\"color: #D4AF37; font-weight: 600;\">307万亿美元</span>\n                </p>\n              </section>\n            </section>\n          </section>\n\n          <section\n            style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #eee; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); margin-top: 20px; position: relative;\">\n            <section style=\"display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: -15px; margin-left: 20px;\">\n              <section\n                style=\"background: #996515; color: #fff; padding: 4px 15px; border-radius: 15px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\">\n                谨慎派警告\n              </section>\n            </section>\n            <section style=\"padding: 25px 15px 15px 15px;\">\n              <section>\n                <p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 10px 0; padding-left: 20px;\">\n                  <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n                    style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;\">\n                    <path d=\"M12,2 L12,16 M12,20 L12,22\" stroke=\"#996515\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" />\n                  </svg>\n                  CME黄金期货净多头处于历史高位\n                </p>\n                <p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 10px 0; padding-left: 20px;\">\n                  <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n                    style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;\">\n                    <path d=\"M12,2 L12,16 M12,20 L12,22\" stroke=\"#996515\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" />\n                  </svg>\n                  美国经济软着陆可能性上升\n                </p>\n                <p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;\">\n                  <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n                    style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;\">\n                    <path d=\"M12,2 L12,16 M12,20 L12,22\" stroke=\"#996515\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" />\n                  </svg>\n                  比特币ETF分流部分资金\n                </p>\n              </section>\n            </section>\n          </section>\n        </section>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <section\n      style=\"padding: 25px 20px; margin: 20px 0; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\n      <h2 style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #D4AF37; margin-bottom: 20px; display: inline-block;\">\n        2024投资指南\n        <span\n          style=\"display: block; width: 100%; height: 2px; background: linear-gradient(to right, #D4AF37, transparent); margin-top: 3px;\"></span>\n      </h2>\n\n      <section style=\"display: flex; align-items: stretch; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n        <section style=\"width: 3px; background: #D4AF37; border-radius: 1.5px; margin-right: 17px; flex-shrink: 0;\">\n        </section>\n        <section style=\"flex: 1;\">\n          <h3 style=\"font-size: 17px; color: #333; margin-bottom: 15px; font-weight: 600;\">1. 政策窗口期</h3>\n          <section style=\"margin-left: 10px;\">\n            <p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 10px 0;\">• 关注美联储议息会议（2024年3月、6月关键节点）</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0;\">• 跟踪上海金溢价指数（每日9:00/14:00更新）</p>\n          </section>\n        </section>\n      </section>\n\n      <section style=\"display: flex; align-items: stretch; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n        <section style=\"width: 3px; background: #996515; border-radius: 1.5px; margin-right: 17px; flex-shrink: 0;\">\n        </section>\n        <section style=\"flex: 1;\">\n          <h3 style=\"font-size: 17px; color: #333; margin-bottom: 15px; font-weight: 600;\">2. 产业链机会</h3>\n          <section style=\"margin-left: 10px;\">\n            <p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 10px 0;\">• 水贝批发市场实时报价</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0;\">• 银行积存金起购点降至<span\n                style=\"color: #D4AF37; font-weight: 600;\">0.1克</span>（工行、招行新政）</p>\n          </section>\n        </section>\n      </section>\n\n      <section style=\"display: flex; align-items: stretch;\">\n        <section style=\"width: 3px; background: #D4AF37; border-radius: 1.5px; margin-right: 17px; flex-shrink: 0;\">\n        </section>\n        <section style=\"flex: 1;\">\n          <h3 style=\"font-size: 17px; color: #333; margin-bottom: 15px; font-weight: 600;\">3. 风险控制</h3>\n          <section style=\"margin-left: 10px;\">\n            <p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 10px 0;\">• 避免杠杆操作（当前波动率达<span\n                style=\"color: #D4AF37; font-weight: 600;\">18%</span>）</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0;\">• 采用定投策略平滑成本</p>\n          </section>\n        </section>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <section\n      style=\"padding: 25px 20px; margin: 20px 0 30px; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\n      <section\n        style=\"background: #f8f5f0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 25px; border-left: 3px solid #D4AF37;\">\n        <p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; font-style: italic; color: #666; margin: 0;\">\n          专家提醒：当广场舞大妈都开始讨论黄金时，或许该保持一份清醒。历史数据显示，每次金价创新高后都会经历剧烈震荡。</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #faf7f2, #f0e9d6); border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px;\">\n        <h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #996515; margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: center; font-weight: 600;\">互动话题\n          #你还会买黄金吗#</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: center;\">欢迎在评论区分享：</p>\n\n        <section\n          style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; background: #fff; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n          <section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center;\">\n            <section\n              style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; background: #D4AF37; color: #fff; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 12px; flex-shrink: 0;\">\n              1</section>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 15px; margin: 0;\">你更倾向传统金条还是Z世代流行的\"金豆\"？</p>\n          </section>\n        </section>\n\n        <section\n          style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; background: #fff; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n          <section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center;\">\n            <section\n              style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; background: #D4AF37; color: #fff; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 12px; flex-shrink: 0;\">\n              2</section>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 15px; margin: 0;\">如何看待3D硬金等新工艺对保值性的影响？</p>\n          </section>\n        </section>\n\n        <section style=\"background: #fff; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n          <section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center;\">\n            <section\n              style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; background: #D4AF37; color: #fff; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 12px; flex-shrink: 0;\">\n              3</section>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 15px; margin: 0;\">你认为比特币会取代黄金的\"避险之王\"地位吗？</p>\n          </section>\n        </section>\n      </section>\n\n      <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #999; text-align: center; margin-top: 20px; font-style: italic;\">\n        （数据截止2023年12月，投资有风险，本文不构成建议）</p>\n    </section>\n\n  </section>\n</body>\n\n</html>"
  },
  "html": "<section style=\"padding: 24px; color: #292b2e; background-color: #fff\"><h1 style=\"font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.5px; margin-bottom: 5px\">把生活里的小事，慢慢做好</h1><section><p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #333; text-align: justify\">生活里有许多值得记录的瞬间。早上推开窗，阳光落在桌面上，新的一天从一杯温水开始。</p><h2 style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #D4AF37; margin-bottom: 15px; display: inline-block\">留一点时间给自己</h2><p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #333; text-align: justify\">每天给自己留出一小段安静的时间，读几页书，或者去楼下走一走。<strong>从一件具体的小事开始</strong>，让改变自然发生。</p><blockquote><p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #333; text-align: justify\">认真对待每一个平常的日子。</p></blockquote><h2 style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #D4AF37; margin-bottom: 15px; display: inline-block\">让行动变得简单</h2><ul><li>选一件今天可以完成的事</li><li>留意自己的真实感受</li><li>给下一次尝试留出余地</li></ul><table><thead><tr><th>时段</th><th>安排</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>早晨</td><td>散步和阅读</td></tr><tr><td>傍晚</td><td>回顾一天</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #333; text-align: justify\">生活不会因为一次决定立刻改变，但持续的行动会慢慢留下痕迹。</p></section></section>",
